******************************************************************
      METALINK,PROBECARDS
******************************************************************

PROBECARDS COP888 (CG/EG/CL/CF/CS)
TO EMULATE ALL COP888.. IT IS POSSIBLE TO USE ONE PROBECARD.
Before connecting the COP8 Probe Card and adapter, please ensure that
the soldering jumpers are configured properly. The jumpers are located
on the adapter board.

Probe Card     Adapter Board     A-B-C Jumper     D-E-F Jumper

  888CF           28 DIP            A-B              Open
                  28 PLCC           A-B              Open
                  40 DIP            A-B              Does not exist
                  44 PLCC           A-B              Does not exist

  888CG           28 DIP            B-C              E-F
                  28 PLCC           B-C              E-F
                  40 DIP            B-C              Does not exist
                  44 PLCC           B-C              Does not exist

  888CL           28 DIP            B-C              D-E
                  28 PLCC           B-C              D-E
                  40 DIP            Open             Does not exist
                  44 PLCC           B-C              Does not exist


TO EMULATE DIFFERENT COP888.. CHANGE CAREFULLY THE MOLE-DEVICE ON THE PROBECARD!
AVAILABLE:
44 PIN PLCC (CG/CS/EG)
40 PIN DIL (ALL)
28 PIN DIL (ALL)

******************************************************************
PROBECARD COP880 (820/840/880)
TO EMULATE ALL COP82./84./88./ONE PROBECARD WITH THE MOLE-CHIP COP880
IS NECESSARY

Probe Card     Adapter Board     A-B-C Jumper     D-E-F Jumper

  880C            28 DIP            B-C              E-F
                  28 PLCC           B-C              E-F
                  40 DIP            B-C              Does not exist
                  44 PLCC           B-C              Does not exist


PLEASE CHANGE THE ADAPTER BOARD FOR THE SEVERAL PIN-CONFIG..
AVAILABLE:
44 PIN PLCC 880
40 PIN DIL 880
28 PIN DIL 820/840/881
20 PIN DIL822/842
